# Cached HTML/PDF pages -- large and fully regeneratable by re-running the
# scraper (main.py re-downloads anything not already in data/raw_html/ or
# data/raw_pdf/). PDF text/OCR extraction results are also cached as
# *.pdf.extract.json sidecars next to each PDF, same reasoning.
data/raw_html/
data/raw_pdf/

# Manually-exported Wind terminal reports used for one-off reconciliation
# (see src/wind_reconcile.py) -- Wind data is licensed to the user, not
# something to redistribute via this repo. Only the *derived* CSV fixes it
# produces get committed.
地方政府债*.xlsx
